  <metadata>
    <name>Grebaje – Karanfili</name>
    <desc>The trail is 2.3 km long, leading from an altitude of 1835 m down to 1141 m, exclusively in the direction of descent. Rocky terrain and a significant elevation drop make it demanding and suitable for more experienced hikers. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
